  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2013-2024 Toyota 4Runner 5 Passenger Model\nw/o Sliding Cargo Deck\nOnly for Carpet Flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are compatible with 2013 2014 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 Toyota 4Runner; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back\nBuilt For Durability: YITAMOTOR 2013-2024 Toyota 4Runner car floor mats are made from premium TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extreme cold or hot environments; Product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The Toyota 4Runner 2013-2024 custom floor mats are uniquely designed channels and raised edges that can effectively trap liquid, debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet\nEasy To Clean: The waterproof floor mats simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals are needed for maintenance\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats for cars are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guards to your vehicle",
